{"title":"30","section":"1021","heading":"Federal exemption from State water laws","lead":"Nothing in this chapter shall constitute an express or implied claim or denial on the part of the Federal Government as to its exemption from State water laws.","tree":[],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"amendments","text":"Amendments2005—Pub. L. 109–58 inserted section catchline."}],"sourceCredit":"(Pub. L. 91–581, § 22, Dec. 24, 1970, 84 Stat. 1573; Pub. L. 109–58, title II, § 236(20), Aug. 8, 2005, 119 Stat. 673.)","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 30—","heading":"MINERAL LANDS AND MINING","identifier":"/us/usc/t30"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 23—","heading":"GEOTHERMAL RESOURCES","identifier":"/us/usc/t30/ch23"}]}